{
  "_comment": "The 0-100 limits for sugars, fat, and salt work because these are grams per 100g and cannot exceed 100g in a 100g serving. The 0-3800 energy ceiling is a broad sanity check for very energy-dense foods and helps catch obviously bad values without being too strict.",
